{
  "method": "Reconstruct candidate filters using only signal-time chart features, prior completed outcomes, and previous-local-date peer bars. PSE candidate calls are always a subset of the actual existing bullish app label. Annual selection uses only validation signals in the preceding two years whose outcomes complete strictly before the test year, minimum 50 calls, six months, ten symbols, >=51% accuracy and >=1 point above validation baseline; otherwise abstain. Baseline for PSE is current bullish app labels, for funds always-down. Test 2020-2026, first monthly close to first close on or after three calendar months within 10 days; ties are incorrect. PSE >=50 bars; funds also require 6- and 12-month price references, matching the earlier bearish fund comparison. Previous fund rule is local score >=55%, bottom peer-return quartile, and market gate below 50%. Prior and new calls differ.",
